WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
From the first booking to the final balance.
One connected hotel workflow.

00:07.000 --> 00:15.000
Start with a clear view of your rooms
and today’s guest activity.

00:15.000 --> 00:26.000
Choose available dates, enter guest details
and confirm the reservation.

00:26.000 --> 00:35.000
At the front desk, verify the guest
and ready room, then check in.

00:35.000 --> 00:46.000
Bring charges and payments together.
Settle the balance before checkout.

00:46.000 --> 00:55.000
After checkout, prepare and inspect the room
for the next arrival.

00:55.000 --> 01:05.000
Review profit and loss, balances,
cash flow and guest receivables.

01:05.000 --> 01:12.000
Coastline PMS.
A clearer way to run your hotel.
